# Real-reconstruction acceptance (M2D.3D1). The commands refuse inputs and outputs inside the repository; these
# rules are a narrow safety net for accidentally copied acceptance evidence. They match the harness's own output names
# only (splat.spz / splat.ply, the report, the review) and acceptance folders, NOT every .spz/.ply, so a curated
# fixture under any other name can still be added with a plain `git add`. Capture photos are covered by the commands'
# refusal of in-repository inputs and by /acceptance*/.
/acceptance/
/acceptance-*/
**/splat.spz
**/splat.ply
acceptance-report.json
human-review.json
run-manifest.json
